          "partner": "visionary",
          "position": "The concern I'd add for a friendly fund is the 'why them' question. The ex-Stripe and ex-Notion backgrounds are genuinely impressive, but neither of them has run an HVAC company or a plumbing operation. Vertical SaaS winners in SMB services — companies like Mindbody, Housecall Pro — typically have founders who lived the problem. I'd want to hear the founders articulate a specific, non-obvious insight about the FSM category that only someone with deep domain exposure would have. If their answer is 'we see the same patterns we saw at Notion/Stripe,' that's a yellow flag for a pure vertical SaaS play."
        },
